<title>USA: Analysis &amp; Technology expands buyback.</title>
<headline>Analysis &amp; Technology expands buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH STONINGTON, Conn. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology Inc said Friday it expanded its share repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said its board authorized the repurchase of an additional 300,000 shares or a total of up to 500,000 shares in amounts and at times and prices to be determined by the company's management.</p>
<p>Since the program was initiated in March 1996, the company has repurchased 206,000 shares, it said.</p>
<p>There are about 2.3 million shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the shares repurchased can be used for company employee benefit plans and for future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
